@Lifepatters

According to EU investigations and multiple Reuters reports, BYD and other Chinese EV makers benefited from significant Chinese state subsidies and industrial support. The EU even imposed extra tariffs on Chinese EVs after concluding that these subsidies distorted competition.

That doesn’t mean BYD is fake or completely unprofitable BYD is still profitable but its rapid global expansion has clearly been helped by heavy state backed support from China, which many governments see as unfair competition in the global auto industry

