@kalindaburtenshaw4392agree. From where I sit (managing a big team of people who sit behind computers and crunch data), AI is a clear and present threat. 

Also, it’s not going to be all or nothing. Some sectors are going to be hit hard, and early. Others not at all (pre-robots which I think are a long way off), and still others are going to see a steady conversion toward AI.

Multiple things can be true at the same time. Yea, the AI bros are overhyping the capabilities of AI now, but there are for sure more jobs at risk than many people - including Scott - want to admit.

